# TDLib surface Telo generates (cmd/tdgen). `fn` is a function Telo calls,
# `type` a constructor Telo decodes or builds, `class` a class whose every
# constructor is generated. Other constructors of a class decode as its
# Unknown value. Regenerate with `make tdapi`.

